s to speak with  France's leader and men well Matt cron  and I am hearing from European diplomats  that they are seeing very similar  intelligence  King what we just told you US  intelligence officials have seen and  they will be discussing this on the call  with Trump military activity and options  have been a point of conversation in  France as well alright great reporting  Margaret Brennan at the White House  thank you
 

